#
# NexoraOS live ISO package list (Debian 13 Trixie, amd64)
# ---------------------------------------------------------
# Format: one package per line, comments start with #.
# live-build installs ALL of these into the chroot before producing the ISO.
#
# Rules:
#   - Only packages available in Debian trixie main/contrib/non-free
#   - No VirtualBox host packages (removed per project requirement)
#   - virtualbox-guest-* is included so NexoraOS runs smoothly AS A GUEST
#   - Keep total install under ~2.5 GB so the ISO stays <1.5 GB after squashfs
#

